#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Algemene instellings"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Display Name of this server"
msgstr "Vertoonnaam van hierdie bediener"

#: includes/arrays.php webseer_servers.php
msgid "Enable Server"
msgid_plural "Enable Servers"
msgstr[0] "Aktiveer bediener"
msgstr[1] "Aktiveer bedieners"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this server from checking urls."
msgstr "Ontmerk hierdie blokkie om te deaktiveer dat hierdie bediener URL'e nagaan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is this server the local server?"
msgstr "Is hierdie bediener die plaaslike bediener?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the current server you are connected to is this entry."
msgstr "Merk hierdie blokkie as die huidige bediener waarmee jy verbind is, hierdie inskrywing is."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Master Server"
msgstr "Meesterbediener"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Sets this server to the Master server.  The Master server handles all Email operations"
msgstr "Stel hierdie bediener as die hoofbediener.  Die hoofbediener hanteer alle E-pos-bewerkings"

#: includes/arrays.php webseer_servers.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "IP-adres"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address to connect to this server"
msgstr "IP-adres om aan hierdie bediener te koppel"

#: includes/arrays.php webseer.php webseer_servers.php
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the URL to connect to remote.php on this server."
msgstr "Dit is die URL om aan remote.php op hierdie bediener te koppel."

#: includes/arrays.php webseer_servers.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Ligging"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Location of this server"
msgstr "Ligging van hierdie bediener"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Dienskontrolenaam"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Die naam wat vir hierdie Dienskontrole vertoon word, en in enige Alarmkennisgewings ingesluit word."

#: includes/arrays.php webseer.php
msgid "Enable Service Check"
msgstr "Aktiveer dienstoets"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this url from being checked."
msgstr "Ontmerk hierdie blokkie om kontrolering van hierdie URL te deaktiveer."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL to Monitor"
msgstr "Die URL om te monitor"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP address to connect to.  Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Voer 'n IP-adres in om mee te verbind. As dit leeg gelaat word, sal DNS-oplossing eerder gebruik word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Instaanbediener"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Indien hierdie verbindingsteks 'n instaanbediener (proxy) vereis, kies dit hier.  Andersins kies 'Geen'."

#: includes/arrays.php webseer.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Geen"

#: includes/arrays.php webseer.php
msgid "Compression"
msgstr "Kompressie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What compression does the server require?  Most servers should not need this, but some will not redirect properly without it."
msgstr "Watter kompressie vereis die bediener?  Die meeste bedieners behoort dit nie nodig te hê nie, maar sommige sal nie behoorlik herlei daarsonder nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Available Checks"
msgstr "Beskikbare kontroles"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Vereis verifikasie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Merk hierdie blokkie as die terrein normaalweg 'n 401-fout terugstuur omdat dit 'n gebruikersnaam en wagwoord vereis."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Kontroleer Sertifikaat"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Indien SSL gebruik word, merk hierdie blokkie as u die sertifikaat wil valideer. By verstek aan; skakel af as die terrein 'n selfondertekende sertifikaat gebruik."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification Timing"
msgstr "Kennisgewingtydsberekening"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Sneller"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many minutes the URL must be down before it will send an alert.  After an alert is sent, in order for a 'Site Recovering' Email to be send, it must also be up this number of minutes."
msgstr "Hoeveel minute die URL af moet wees voordat dit 'n waarskuwing stuur. Nadat 'n waarskuwing gestuur is, moet dit ook vir hierdie aantal minute op wees voordat 'n 'Terrein herstel'-e-pos gestuur word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Time Out"
msgstr "Uitteltyd"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many seconds to allow the page to timeout before reporting it as down."
msgstr "Hoeveel sekondes om toe te laat vir die bladsy se tydsverstreking voordat dit as af gerapporteer word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Verifikasiestringe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Antwoordsoekstring"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the URL response for a live and working Web Service."
msgstr "Dit is die string om in die URL-reaksie na te soek vir 'n aktiewe en werkende webdiens."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance Page"
msgstr "Antwoordsoekstring - Onderhoudsbladsy"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance Page.  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the Web Service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Dit is die string om op die Onderhoudsbladsy na te soek. Die dienskontrole sal vir hierdie string kontroleer as bogenoemde string nie gevind word nie. Indien gevind, beteken dit dat die webdiens onder onderhoud is."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Antwoordsoekstring - Misluk"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the Web Service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Dit is die string om na te soek vir 'n bekende mislukking in die webdiensreaksie. Die dienskontrole sal slegs 'n alarm gee as hierdie string gevind word, en enige tydsverstrekingsprobleme en die soekstringe hierbo ignoreer."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification Settings"
msgstr "Kennisgewinginstellings"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notify Format"
msgstr "Kennisgewingformaat"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the format to use when sending the notification email"
msgstr "Dit is die formaat wat gebruik moet word wanneer die kennisgewing-e-pos gestuur word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification List"
msgstr "Kennisgewingslys"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use this Notification List for those to be notified when this website goes down."
msgstr "Gebruik hierdie kennisgewingslys vir diegene wat in kennis gestel moet word wanneer hierdie webwerf afgaan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notify Accounts"
msgstr "Stel rekeninge in kennis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is a listing of accounts that will be notified when this website goes down."
msgstr "Dit is 'n lys van rekeninge wat in kennis gestel sal word wanneer hierdie webwerf afgaan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Extra Alert Emails"
msgstr "Ekstra waarskuwings-e-posse"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You may specify here extra Emails to receive alerts for this URL (comma separated)"
msgstr "Jy kan hier ekstra E-posse spesifiseer om alarms vir hierdie URL te ontvang (komma-geskei)"

